WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.600 --> 00:00:02.298 line:88% align:center
Quick edits happen on the chart.

2
00:00:02.348 --> 00:00:05.085 line:88% align:center
For everything else, there is the Properties panel.

3
00:00:06.733 --> 00:00:07.360 line:88% align:center
Click a bar,

4
00:00:07.410 --> 00:00:10.464 line:88% align:center
and all of its settings open in the panel on the right,

5
00:00:10.514 --> 00:00:12.834 line:88% align:center
beside the chart rather than on top of it.

6
00:00:13.600 --> 00:00:15.557 line:88% align:center
Change a date or pick a new colour,

7
00:00:15.607 --> 00:00:17.507 line:88% align:center
and the chart follows as you type,

8
00:00:17.557 --> 00:00:19.802 line:88% align:center
so you can see the effect straight away.

9
00:00:20.533 --> 00:00:24.189 line:88% align:center
The hover card and the details dialog are written here too,

10
00:00:24.239 --> 00:00:26.513 line:88% align:center
in plain text with simple formatting.

11
00:00:26.563 --> 00:00:29.528 line:88% align:center
The preview underneath shows how each will read.

12
00:00:30.267 --> 00:00:33.001 line:88% align:center
Further down, you can set the size of the labels

13
00:00:33.051 --> 00:00:35.147 line:88% align:center
and the size of the dates separately,

14
00:00:35.197 --> 00:00:38.280 line:88% align:center
which helps when the roadmap is shown on a big screen.

15
00:00:39.033 --> 00:00:40.850 line:88% align:center
The header has its own settings.

16
00:00:40.900 --> 00:00:43.242 line:88% align:center
Choose a size and a font for the heading,

17
00:00:43.292 --> 00:00:46.508 line:88% align:center
and give the cards tab a name that suits your programme.

18
00:00:47.267 --> 00:00:50.645 line:88% align:center
The date chip in the corner can be switched off altogether,

19
00:00:50.695 --> 00:00:53.782 line:88% align:center
or kept on screen and left out of anything you export.

20
00:00:54.533 --> 00:00:57.672 line:88% align:center
And under Timeline, you set the year the roadmap starts,

21
00:00:57.722 --> 00:00:59.267 line:88% align:center
and how many years it shows.

22
00:01:00.033 --> 00:01:01.992 line:88% align:center
When you want more room for the chart,

23
00:01:02.042 --> 00:01:05.322 line:88% align:center
the Properties button tucks the panel away, and brings it back.

24
00:01:06.067 --> 00:01:08.464 line:88% align:center
You can also work directly on the bars.

25
00:01:08.514 --> 00:01:11.916 line:88% align:center
Drag one to move it, drag an edge to change its length,

26
00:01:11.966 --> 00:01:15.430 line:88% align:center
and if you change your mind, Undo takes you back a step.

